# Hard geometric-measure-theory statements from Mattila

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from Pertti Mattila,
*Geometry of Sets and Measures in EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin Spaces)*.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/MattilaGeometry/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/MattilaGeometry/Defs.lean`.
-/
